### 1. Owner สมัครใช้งาน (Register)
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_name": "Owner",
  "contact_info": "0123456789",
  "email": "owner1@gmail.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}
### 2. Owner ใช้รหัสผ่านแบบใช้แล้วทิ้งเข้าสู่ระบบ
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner1@gmail.com",
  "password": "SecurePass4567!"
}

### 3. Owner ขอ OTP สำหรับรีเซ็ตรหัสผ่าน (Forgot Password)
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 16
branch_id: 2
{
  "usernameOrEmail": "owner1@gmail.com"
}

### 4. Owner ยืนยัน OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 16
branch_id: 2
{
  "usernameOrEmail": "owner1@gmail.com",
  "otp": "155693"
}


### 5. Owner รีเซ็ตรหัสผ่านใหม่
PATCH http://localhost:3000/owner/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 16
branch_id: 2
{
  "email": "owner1@gmail.com",
  "newPassword": "SecurePass4567!"
}

